@host = http://localhost:3000

### Health -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Listar -> 200 com 3 registros após db:reset
GET {{host}}/api/medications

### Filtrar por paciente (bônus)
GET {{host}}/api/medications?patientName=Ana

### Obter existente -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/medications/1

### Obter inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/medications/9999

### Criar válida -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/medications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Igor Bastos Teixeira",
  "medicationName": "Amoxicilina",
  "dosage": "875mg",
  "route": "Oral",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-09-10T18:00",
  "notes": ""
}

### Criar sem patientName -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/medications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "medicationName": "Amoxicilina",
  "dosage": "875mg",
  "route": "Oral",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-09-10T18:00"
}

### Criar com data inválida -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/medications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Teste",
  "medicationName": "X",
  "dosage": "1mg",
  "route": "Oral",
  "scheduledAt": "10/09/2026 18:00"
}

### Remover existente -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/medications/1

### Remover de novo -> 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/medications/1
